    {
      "Id": 160170800,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "아"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170810,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "으으ㅏㅏ아"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170820,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "그 그렇다면……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170830,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "자려고 누웠는데요"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170840,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "역시나 오늘도"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170850,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "내일이 기대돼요"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170860,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "응. 나도."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170870,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "네에"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170880,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "모두"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170890,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "선생님 덕분이에요"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170900,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "난 딱히 한 게 없는걸"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170910,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "모두 아오바의 마음이 만들어낸 거야"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170920,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ㅎㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170930,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "그럴지도요"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170940,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "그래도 감사해요"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170950,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "정말로."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170960,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "안녕히 주무세요"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Id": 160170010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Hello Sensei"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170030,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Hi Aoba!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heehee"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170050,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "You really responded to me..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170060,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Um, by the way"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Would it be okay"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "if I asked you something later?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170090,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170100,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Ask me whenever."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170110,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "Thank you..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei, thank you"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "so much for today"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "We have lots of supplies now."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170150,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I hope you use them well."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "By the way, what was it you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "That's..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Can I ask you next time?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170200,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Yes, anytime."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Okay, thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Then I hope"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I can see you again soon!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "asdafghklja"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170250,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Aoba???"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170260,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's nothing!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170270,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170280,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's Aoba."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm sorry, this is out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "But if you don't mind,"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170310,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I was wondering if I could get a bit of your help today..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170320,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Of course! Where do you need me?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170330,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170340,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Thank you"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170350,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "for always being so helpful."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "The location would be..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170370,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170380,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Thank you so much for today."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170390,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I can't always be receiving help from you."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170400,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "So if there's ever anything I can do,"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "please just let me know"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170420,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Yes, I will."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170430,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Thank you for the hard work today, Aoba."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170440,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "No, I'm the grateful one."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'll talk to you later then"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei, this is Aoba."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170470,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Is there anything you own that's broken"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170480,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "and inconveniencing you?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170490,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Now that you mention it..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Is there something?!?!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170510,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "My coffee maker broke, so..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'll be there soon!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Wait for me!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170540,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "It's really not that urgent..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "I'll be there soon!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170560,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei, the food was"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "really good and filling today."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170590,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I'm glad you enjoyed it."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170600,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Let me know the next time you're eating alone."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170610,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Actually, no."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170620,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's best for days like these"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170630,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "to be rare occasions."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170640,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "That way"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170650,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "um"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170660,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "nevermind"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170670,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Anyways, thank you so much!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170680,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I have a huge problem today"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170690,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "There's so much work"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170700,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "that I might have to pull an all-nighter..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170710,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Could I help?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170720,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Pardon?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170730,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei wou"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170740,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "No"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170750,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I didn't"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170760,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "mean that"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170770,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "when I said"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170780,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170790,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Two people are faster than one."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170800,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170810,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Aaaaaaaaaah"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170820,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "iiin that case."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170830,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I laid down to go to sleep,"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170840,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "and today as well, I'm really"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170850,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "looking forward to tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170860,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Yeah. Me too."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170870,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170880,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's all"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170890,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "thanks to you."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170900,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I really didn't do much."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170910,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "It was all you and your heart, Aoba."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170920,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heeheehee."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170930,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Perhaps."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170940,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "But still, thank you."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170950,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Really."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160170960,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Good night."
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
